    "topic": "**fpgas.online**: free remote access to real FPGA boards from your browser. Build a bitstream with open source toolchains, upload it, and watch the board on a live camera feed. This channel is for its continued development.\n\n**Sites**\n• [ps1.fpgas.online](https://ps1.fpgas.online/): Pumping Station: One hackerspace, Chicago, USA\n• [welland.fpgas.online](https://welland.fpgas.online/): Welland, near Adelaide, Australia\n• [tinytapeout.fpgas.online](https://tinytapeout.fpgas.online/): Tiny Tapeout demo boards\n**Docs**\n• [fpgas.online](https://fpgas.online/): start here\n• [docs.fpgas.online](https://docs.fpgas.online/): full reference\n• [Getting Started](https://github.com/CarlFK/pici/wiki/Getting-Started)\n**Source**\n• [fpgas-online](https://github.com/fpgas-online) organisation\n• [pici](https://github.com/CarlFK/pici)"
