      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": true,
      "content": "# Welcome to #\uD83D\uDCE1-fpgas-online\nThis channel is for developing **fpgas.online**: free remote access to real FPGA development boards, and now Tiny Tapeout boards too, from your browser. Build a bitstream with whatever toolchain you like, upload it, and watch the board on a live camera. @Tim 'mithro' Ansell and @carlfk look after this channel.\n\n**FPGA boards**\n- [ps1.fpgas.online](<https://ps1.fpgas.online/>): Pumping Station: One, Chicago (Arty A7 and LiteFury)\n- [welland.fpgas.online](<https://welland.fpgas.online/>): near Adelaide, Australia (Arty, NeTV2, Fomu and Acorn)\n\n**Tiny Tapeout boards**\n- [tinytapeout.fpgas.online](<https://tinytapeout.fpgas.online/>): Tiny Tapeout demo boards with real open source silicon\n\n**Docs**\n- [docs.fpgas.online](<https://docs.fpgas.online/>)\n- [Getting Started](<https://github.com/CarlFK/pici/wiki/Getting-Started>)\n\n**Source**\n- [fpgas-online](<https://github.com/fpgas-online>)\n- [pici](<https://github.com/CarlFK/pici>)\n\nReport broken boards, suggest features, or help with the infrastructure here.",
